---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms and Conditions | GoGreen Builders"
  description="Terms and conditions for GoGreen Builders LLC website usage, contractor estimates, and California state licensing disclosures."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-16 sm:py-20 border-b border-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 tracking-tight">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-2">Last Updated: 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 prose prose-gray prose-sm sm:prose-base space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        Welcome to gogreenbuilders.com. By accessing or using our website, requesting an estimate, or communicating with GoGreen Builders LLC, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2">1. Contractor Licensing Disclosures</h2>
      <p>
        GoGreen Builders LLC is a licensed, bonded, and insured contractor operating in the State of California under California Contractors State License Board (CSLB) License #1064369, holding Classifications B (General Building), C39 (Roofing), and C46 (Solar).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2">2. Estimates and Proposals</h2>
      <p>
        Preliminary online figures, calculator results, and general estimates provided on this website are informational and subject to on-site verification, physical structural assessment, city engineering requirements, and final written contract agreements.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        All content, branding, logos, copy, photographs, and code on this website are the intellectual property of GoGreen Builders LLC or used with appropriate permission. Unauthorized reproduction, scraping, or distribution is prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-2">4. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        Questions regarding these Terms should be directed to:<br>
        GoGreen Builders LLC<br>
        15335 Morrison St. Suite 130, Sherman Oaks, CA 91403<br>
        Phone: (818) 443-6678
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
